# DS5002: a timechart needs a datetime x and the result has none; the message lists the columns with types.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| summarize revenue = sum(revenue) by customerId
| render timechart
---- expected
error[DS5002]: `timechart` needs a `datetime` column for the x-axis, but the result has none
  --> query:3:10
  |
3 | | render timechart
  |          ^^^^^^^^^ no column for the x-axis
  |
  = help: convert a column with `extend` before `render`
  = note: the result's columns: customerId: string, revenue: real
